### 1. Clear the alert (404 the first time is fine)
DELETE http://localhost:5056/alerts/194a98e8-4faa-48fb-a5f1-e90510f57ca7/PowerSpike

### 2. Mains power spike (this raises a new PowerSpike alert; wait a second after sending)
POST http://localhost:5056/telemetry/electrical
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sensorId": "194a98e8-4faa-48fb-a5f1-e90510f57ca7", "value": { "watts": 6000 } }

### 3. The user reacts: turn Pump A OFF
POST http://localhost:5056/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "on": false, "sensorIds": ["e2408b27-b9a0-4125-9a9b-437e9b06f9d9"] }

### 4. Reset: turn Pump A back ON
POST http://localhost:5056/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{ "on": true, "sensorIds": ["e2408b27-b9a0-4125-9a9b-437e9b06f9d9"] }

### 5. Ask for suggestions
GET http://localhost:5056/insights/suggestions